<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish June producer prices up 0.3 pct m/m - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish June producer prices up 0.3 pct m/m - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for manufacturing industies rose 0.3 percent in June and were down 0.7 percent from a year ago, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Index (base 1985)  Monthly change  Yearly change June 1997   120.0	   +0.3		 -0.7</p>
<p>May  1997   119.7	   +0.4		 -1.5</p>
<p>June 1996   120.9	   -0.5		 +0.8</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom +353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
